  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 24/07/2024, the proposal as shown on the drawings submitted on 24/07/2024 and numbered D/664/01-9C,   D/664/02-9C, D/664/03-9C  was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because the property is subject to the following permitted development restrictions :\r\nThere are planning conditions, in particular Condition 21, attached to the original consent for the subject dwelling (ref: P/2012/2053, 01322/C/P1) which remove permitted development rights for further extensions and additions to this property.\r\nIf the applicant wishes to carry out any enlargement to the existing property, a planning application must be made to the Local Planning Authority in this regard.\r\n"
